26-09-17T01:52:45.461Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-17T04:37:31.589Z","title":"无糖食品不含糖，多吃不会胖……是真是假？","subtitle":"","summary":"按照《食品安全国家标准 预包装食品标签通则》规定，无糖是指每100克或每100毫升食品中，糖(包括蔗糖、果糖、葡萄糖等)的含量不高于0.5克。因此，无糖不等于绝对不含糖。 无糖食品仍含有碳水化合物、脂肪、蛋白质等供能营养","channel":"health","tags":["健康"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491965.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkexh8xr14r-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":0,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.016Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvusw68k9m8","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.97},{"id":"n_mu4vkez9tai16z","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.525Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-17T04:37:10.846Z","title":"广东试点“疫苗处方” 把预防接种融入日常诊疗","subtitle":"","summary":"广东今年试点“疫苗处方”，广州市海珠区是该省首个实现全区推广的行政区。 该区疾控中心副主任朱凯星30日表示，全域推行“疫苗处方”服务1个月以来，居民接种便利性提升，疫苗可预防传染病发病率有所下降，将鼓励各试点单位积极探索","channel":"health","tags":["健康"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491964.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkez9tai16z-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":0,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.013Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvust4arydq","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.97},{"id":"n_mu4vkf14m5dxga","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.592Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-17T04:36:58.450Z","title":"专家：只靠意志力戒烟太难，需掌握科学方法","subtitle":"","summary":"5月31日是第38个世界无烟日。日前发布的2024中国成人烟草调查结果显示，中国15岁及以上人群吸烟率为23.2%。 在许多烟民眼中，戒烟是一件需要“钢铁意志力”的事，过程痛苦且漫长。什么原因导致戒